## Final Status
- Completed: 2026-10-01
- Tests: ✓ (61/61 backend tests passing; zero regressions)
- Security review: ✓ (Multi-tenant scoping by college_id & program_id; IQA authorization gates enforced)
- File limits: ✓ (All Vue components strictly under 180 lines)
- UI Standard: ✓ (100% DaisyUI classes: select, table, collapse, input, btn, card, badge)
- Known limitations: None.

## Lessons & Notes
- Converting the official 10 Master Survey Instrument Excel files directly into a cleanly structured JSON file (`programSurveyData.json`) imported by `selfSurveyData.js` allowed us to support all 10 Program Accreditation areas and over 1,000 criteria without violating the 150-200 line SFC rule.
- Positioning Print/Export alongside the Submit action creates an intuitive completion flow for evaluators preparing and printing survey forms.

